<section class="band problem"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">Why it matters</div>
  <p style="margin-top:14px">A development, a purchase, a restructuring, where the money goes &mdash; these are decided long before the closing. Most people make them with <b>scattered advice and no one holding the whole picture.</b> CSH is the consultant who does: we help you see the whole board and bring the right licensed specialists in.</p>
</div></section>

