  <div class="sec-head center"><div class="eyebrow">What we do</div><h2>Advisory that has done the work.</h2><p>Not a deck and a junior team &mdash; you work directly with the principal, and the advice is the same we&rsquo;d give if it were our own capital in the deal.</p></div>
